{"seq":4,"slug":"ci-for-ios","title":"iOS 持续集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/testing-architecture/ci-for-ios","wordCount":745,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"ios-持续集成\">iOS 持续集成</h1><p>持续集成（CI）是保障 iOS 项目质量的基础设施。本文介绍 GitHub Actions、Fastlane、Xcode Cloud 的配置，以及测试并行化和代码签名管理。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>iOS 持续集成把构建、测试、签名、分发串成自动流水线，围绕几个概念展开：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>平台选择</strong>：GitHub Actions、Fastlane、Xcode Cloud 各有适配场景</li>\n<li><strong>流水线配置</strong>：定义触发条件与步骤，自动执行构建与测试</li>\n<li><strong>测试并行化</strong>：把测试分片并行执行，缩短反馈时间</li>\n<li><strong>代码签名管理</strong>：在 CI 中安全地提供证书与描述文件</li>\n</ul>\n<p>其中<strong>代码签名</strong>是 iOS CI 特有的难点：签名资产必须安全注入且不落明文，否则流水线与证书都面临风险。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"ci-平台选择\">CI 平台选择</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    CI[&quot;iOS CI 平台&quot;]&#10;    CI --&gt; GHA[&quot;GitHub Actions&quot;]&#10;    CI --&gt; XCCloud[&quot;Xcode Cloud&quot;]&#10;    CI --&gt; Bitrise[&quot;Bitrise&quot;]&#10;    CI --&gt; Jenkins[&quot;Jenkins&quot;]&#10;&#10;    GHA --&gt; GHADesc[&quot;灵活,社区生态丰富&quot;]&#10;    XCCloud --&gt; XCDesc[&quot;苹果原生,零配置签名&quot;]&#10;    Bitrise --&gt; BDesc[&quot;iOS 专用,GUI 配置&quot;]&#10;    Jenkins --&gt; JDesc[&quot;自托管,完全可控&quot;]&#10;&#10;    classDef platform fill:none,stroke:#2196F3&#10;    classDef desc fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50&#10;&#10;    class CI platform&#10;    class GHA,XCCloud,Bitrise,Jenkins platform&#10;    class GHADesc,XCDesc,BDesc,JDesc desc\">graph TD\n    CI[\"iOS CI 平台\"]\n    CI --&gt; GHA[\"GitHub Actions\"]\n    CI --&gt; XCCloud[\"Xcode Cloud\"]\n    CI --&gt; Bitrise[\"Bitrise\"]\n    CI --&gt; Jenkins[\"Jenkins\"]\n\n    GHA --&gt; GHADesc[\"灵活,社区生态丰富\"]\n    XCCloud --&gt; XCDesc[\"苹果原生,零配置签名\"]\n    Bitrise --&gt; BDesc[\"iOS 专用,GUI 配置\"]\n    Jenkins --&gt; JDesc[\"自托管,完全可控\"]\n\n    classDef platform fill:none,stroke:#2196F3\n    classDef desc fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50\n\n    class CI platform\n    class GHA,XCCloud,Bitrise,Jenkins platform\n    class GHADesc,XCDesc,BDesc,JDesc desc</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>费用</th>\n<th>macOS Runner</th>\n<th>签名管理</th>\n<th>设置复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GitHub Actions</td>\n<td>按分钟计费</td>\n<td>苹果芯片可用</td>\n<td>需手动配置</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Xcode Cloud</td>\n<td>25 小时/月免费</td>\n<td>原生支持</td>\n<td>自动管理</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bitrise</td>\n<td>按计划付费</td>\n<td>专用 Runner</td>\n<td>内置支持</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Jenkins</td>\n<td>自托管成本</td>\n<td>自行提供</td>\n<td>需手动配置</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"github-actions-配置\">GitHub Actions 配置</h2><p>完整的 iOS CI 工作流：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// .github/workflows/ios.yml 等效逻辑&#10;// name: iOS CI&#10;//&#10;// on:&#10;//   push:&#10;//     branches: [main, develop]&#10;//   pull_request:&#10;//     branches: [main]&#10;//&#10;// concurrency:&#10;//   group: ${{ github.workflow }}-${{ github.ref }}&#10;//   cancel-in-progress: true&#10;//&#10;// jobs:&#10;//   build-and-test:&#10;//     runs-on: macos-14&#10;//     timeout-minutes: 30&#10;//     steps:&#10;//       - uses: actions/checkout@v4&#10;//&#10;//       - name: Cache SPM&#10;//         uses: actions/cache@v4&#10;//         with:&#10;//           path: |&#10;//             ~/Library/Caches/org.swift.swiftpm&#10;//             .build&#10;//           key: spm-${{ hashFiles(&#39;**/Package.resolved&#39;) }}&#10;//&#10;//       - name: Select Xcode&#10;//         run: sudo xcode-select -s /Applications/Xcode_15.4.app&#10;//&#10;//       - name: Resolve packages&#10;//         run: xcodebuild -resolvePackageDependencies -scheme MyApp&#10;//&#10;//       - name: Build&#10;//         run: |&#10;//           xcodebuild build-for-testing \\&#10;//             -scheme MyApp \\&#10;//             -destination &#39;platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 15 Pro&#39; \\&#10;//             -resultBundlePath build/Build.xcresult&#10;//&#10;//       - name: Test&#10;//         run: |&#10;//           xcodebuild test-without-building \\&#10;//             -scheme MyApp \\&#10;//             -destination &#39;platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 15 Pro&#39; \\&#10;//             -resultBundlePath build/Test.xcresult \\&#10;//             -parallel-testing-enabled YES \\&#10;//             -maximum-parallel-testing-workers 3&#10;//&#10;//       - name: Upload results&#10;//         if: always()&#10;//         uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4&#10;//         with:&#10;//           name: test-results&#10;//           path: build/*.xcresult\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// .github/workflows/ios.yml 等效逻辑</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// name: iOS CI</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// on:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   push:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//     branches: [main, develop]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   pull_request:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//     branches: [main]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// concurrency:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   group: ${{ github.workflow }}-${{ github.ref }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   cancel-in-progress: true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// jobs:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   build-and-test:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//     runs-on: macos-14</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//     timeout-minutes: 30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//     steps:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//       - uses: actions/checkout@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//       - name: Cache SPM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//         uses: actions/cache@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//         with:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//           path: |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//             ~/Library/Caches/org.swift.swiftpm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//             .build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//           key: spm-${{ hashFiles('**/Package.resolved') }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//       - name: Select Xcode</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//         run: sudo xcode-select -s /Applications/Xcode_15.4.app</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//       - name: Resolve packages</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//         run: xcodebuild -resolvePackageDependencies -scheme MyApp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//       - name: Build</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//         run: |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//           xcodebuild build-for-testing \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//             -scheme MyApp \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//             -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 15 Pro' \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//             -resultBundlePath build/Build.xcresult</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//       - name: Test</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//         run: |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//           xcodebuild test-without-building \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//             -scheme MyApp \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//             -destination 'platform=iOS Simulator,name=iPhone 15 Pro' \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//             -resultBundlePath build/Test.xcresult \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//             -parallel-testing-enabled YES \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//             -maximum-parallel-testing-workers 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//       - name: Upload results</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//         if: always()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//         uses: actions/upload-artifact@v4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//         with:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//           name: test-results</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//           path: build/*.xcresult</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"fastlane-集成\">Fastlane 集成</h2><p>Fastlane 简化了 iOS CI 中的常见任务：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// Fastfile&#10;default_platform(:ios)&#10;&#10;platform :ios do&#10;    before_all do&#10;        setup_ci if ENV[&quot;CI&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    desc &quot;代码规范检查&quot;&#10;    lane :lint do&#10;        swiftlint(&#10;            mode: :lint,&#10;            config_file: &quot;.swiftlint.yml&quot;,&#10;            raise_if_swiftlint_error: true&#10;        )&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    desc &quot;运行所有测试&quot;&#10;    lane :test do&#10;        run_tests(&#10;            scheme: &quot;MyApp&quot;,&#10;            device: &quot;iPhone 15 Pro&quot;,&#10;            clean: true,&#10;            code_coverage: true,&#10;            parallel_testing: true,&#10;            concurrent_workers: 3,&#10;            result_bundle: true,&#10;            output_types: &quot;html,junit&quot;&#10;        )&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    desc &quot;构建并分发到 TestFlight&quot;&#10;    lane :beta do&#10;        sync_code_signing(type: &quot;appstore&quot;)&#10;&#10;        increment_build_number(&#10;            build_number: ENV[&quot;GITHUB_RUN_NUMBER&quot;]&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        build_app(&#10;            scheme: &quot;MyApp&quot;,&#10;            export_method: &quot;app-store&quot;,&#10;            clean: true&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        upload_to_testflight(&#10;            skip_waiting_for_build_processing: true&#10;        )&#10;&#10;        slack(&#10;            message: &quot;TestFlight 构建完成 🎉&quot;,&#10;            success: true&#10;        )&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    error do |lane, exception|&#10;        slack(&#10;            message: &quot;CI 失败: #{exception.message}&quot;,&#10;            success: false&#10;        )&#10;    end&#10;end\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Fastfile</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">default_platform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ios)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">platform </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ios </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    before_all </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        setup_ci </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ENV[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CI\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    desc </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"代码规范检查\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    lane </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lint </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        swiftlint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            mode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">lint,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            config_file</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".swiftlint.yml\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            raise_if_swiftlint_error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark