shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// brew install swiftgen sourcery</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ci_scripts/ci_pre_xcodebuild.sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// #!/bin/sh</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在 xcodebuild 之前执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 运行代码生成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// swiftgen config run</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// sourcery --config .sourcery.yml</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Xcode Cloud 特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>自动签名</td>\n<td>无需管理证书和描述文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TestFlight 集成</td>\n<td>构建完成自动分发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>并行测试</td>\n<td>原生支持多设备并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自定义脚本</td>\n<td>ci_scripts 目录下的 shell 脚本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>启动条件</td>\n<td>分支/标签/PR/定时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"测试并行化\">测试并行化</h2><p>iOS 测试并行化有两个层次：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    Parallel[&quot;测试并行化&quot;]&#10;    Parallel --&gt; ClassLevel[&quot;类级并行&quot;]&#10;    Parallel --&gt; TargetLevel[&quot;Target 级并行&quot;]&#10;&#10;    ClassLevel --&gt; Sim1[&quot;Simulator Clone 1&lt;br/&gt;TestClassA&quot;]&#10;    ClassLevel --&gt; Sim2[&quot;Simulator Clone 2&lt;br/&gt;TestClassB&quot;]&#10;    ClassLevel --&gt; Sim3[&quot;Simulator Clone 3&lt;br/&gt;TestClassC&quot;]&#10;&#10;    TargetLevel --&gt; T1[&quot;UnitTests Target&quot;]&#10;    TargetLevel --&gt; T2[&quot;IntegrationTests Target&quot;]&#10;    TargetLevel --&gt; T3[&quot;SnapshotTests Target&quot;]&#10;&#10;    classDef root fill:none,stroke:#FF9800&#10;    classDef level fill:none,stroke:#2196F3&#10;    classDef sim fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50&#10;&#10;    class Parallel root&#10;    class ClassLevel,TargetLevel level&#10;    class Sim1,Sim2,Sim3,T1,T2,T3 sim\">graph TD\n    Parallel[\"测试并行化\"]\n    Parallel --&gt; ClassLevel[\"类级并行\"]\n    Parallel --&gt; TargetLevel[\"Target 级并行\"]\n\n    ClassLevel --&gt; Sim1[\"Simulator Clone 1&lt;br/&gt;TestClassA\"]\n    ClassLevel --&gt; Sim2[\"Simulator Clone 2&lt;br/&gt;TestClassB\"]\n    ClassLevel --&gt; Sim3[\"Simulator Clone 3&lt;br/&gt;TestClassC\"]\n\n    TargetLevel --&gt; T1[\"UnitTests Target\"]\n    TargetLevel --&gt; T2[\"IntegrationTests Target\"]\n    TargetLevel --&gt; T3[\"SnapshotTests Target\"]\n\n    classDef root fill:none,stroke:#FF9800\n    classDef level fill:none,stroke:#2196F3\n    classDef sim fill:none,stroke:#4CAF50\n\n    class Parallel root\n    class ClassLevel,TargetLevel level\n    class Sim1,Sim2,Sim3,T1,T2,T3 sim</pre><p>Xcode 并行测试配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// 在 xcodebuild 命令中启用&#10;// -parallel-testing-enabled YES&#10;// -maximum-parallel-testing-workers 4&#10;&#10;// 在 Xcode scheme 中配置&#10;// Edit Scheme → Test → Options → Execute in parallel\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在 xcodebuild 命令中启用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// -parallel-testing-enabled YES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// -maximum-parallel-testing-workers 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在 Xcode scheme 中配置</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Edit Scheme → Test → Options → Execute in parallel</span></span></code></pre></div><p>测试分片策略：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// 使用 Test Plan 将测试分组&#10;// MyApp.xctestplan&#10;// {&#10;//   &quot;configurations&quot;: [&#10;//     {&#10;//       &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Unit Tests&quot;,&#10;//       &quot;options&quot;: {&#10;//         &quot;maximumParallelTestWorkers&quot;: 4&#10;//       },&#10;//       &quot;targets&quot;: [&#10;//         { &quot;target&quot;: { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;UnitTests&quot; } }&#10;//       ]&#10;//     },&#10;//     {&#10;//       &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Snapshot Tests&quot;,&#10;//       &quot;options&quot;: {&#10;//         &quot;maximumParallelTestWorkers&quot;: 1  // 快照测试不并行&#10;//       },&#10;//       &quot;targets&quot;: [&#10;//         { &quot;target&quot;: { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;SnapshotTests&quot; } }&#10;//       ]&#10;//     }&#10;//   ]&#10;// }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 使用 Test Plan 将测试分组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// MyApp.xctestplan</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   \"configurations\": [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//     {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//       \"name\": \"Unit Tests\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//       \"options\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//         \"maximumParallelTestWorkers\": 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//       },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//       \"targets\": [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//         { \"target\": { \"name\": \"UnitTests\" } }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//       ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//     },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//     {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//       \"name\": \"Snapshot Tests\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//       \"options\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//         \"maximumParallelTestWorkers\": 1  // 快照测试不并行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//       },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//       \"targets\": [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//         { \"target\": { \"name\": \"SnapshotTests\" } }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//       ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//     }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// }</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 快照测试不应并行执行，因为多个模拟器实例的渲染可能不一致。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"代码签名管理\">代码签名管理</h2><p>CI 环境中的代码签名是最常见的难题之一：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"swift\" data-code=\"// Fastlane Match — 团队级证书管理&#10;// match(&#10;//   type: &quot;appstore&quot;,&#10;//   app_identifier: &quot;com.example.myapp&quot;,&#10;//   git_url: &quot;https://github.com/team/certificates&quot;,&#10;//   readonly: true  // CI 环境只读&#10;// )&#10;&#10;// 手动管理 — 通过 Keychain 导入&#10;// security create-keychain -p &quot;&quot; build.keychain&#10;// security import certificate.p12 -k build.keychain -P $CERT_PASSWORD -T /usr/bin/codesign&#10;// security set-key-partition-list -S apple-tool:,apple: -s -k &quot;&quot; build.keychain\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Fastlane Match — 团队级证书管理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// match(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   type: \"appstore\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   app_identifier: \"com.example.myapp\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   git_url: \"https://github.com/team/certificates\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">//   readonly: true  // CI 环境只读</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 手动管理 — 通过 Keychain 导入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// security create-keychain -p \"\" build.keychain</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// security import certificate.p12 -k build.keychain -P $CERT_PASSWORD -T /usr/bin/codesign</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// security set-key-partition-list -S apple-tool:,apple: -s -k \"\" build.keychain</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>安全性</th>\n<th>推荐度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Fastlane Match</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>高（加密 Git 仓库）</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Xcode Cloud</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>最高（苹果托管）</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>App Store Connect API Key</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>⭐⭐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手动 Keychain</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>⭐</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"ci-最佳实践\">CI 最佳实践</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实践</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>缓存 SPM 依赖</td>\n<td>避免每次构建重新下载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PR 合并前强制 CI 通过</td>\n<td>保护分支规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构建产物归档</td>\n<td>上传 xcresult 用于调试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通知集成</td>\n<td>Slack/飞书通知构建结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定时构建</td>\n<td>每日 nightly build 全量测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>超时设置</td>\n<td>防止卡住的构建占用资源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>GitHub Actions 灵活且社区生态丰富，是 iOS CI 的主流选择</li>\n<li>Fastlane 封装了构建、测试、签名、分发等常见 CI 任务</li>\n<li>Xcode Cloud 零配置签名，深度集成苹果生态，适合小团队</li>\n<li>测试并行化分为类级和 Target 级，快照测试需串行执行</li>\n<li>Fastlane Match 是团队证书管理的最佳方案，加密存储在 Git 仓库</li>\n<li>CI 应包含 lint、编译、测试、静态分析的完整流水线</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"iOS 持续集成","id":"ios-持续集成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"CI 平台选择","id":"ci-平台选择"},{"level":2,"text":"GitHub Actions 配置","id":"github-actions-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"Fastlane 集成","id":"fastlane-集成"},{"level":2,"text":"Xcode Cloud","id":"xcode-cloud"},{"level":2,"text":"测试并行化","id":"测试并行化"},{"level":2,"text":"代码签名管理","id":"代码签名管理"},{"level":2,"text":"CI 最佳实践","id":"ci-最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"集成测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/ios-architecture/testing-architecture/integration-testing"},"next":null}